description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants Instant ATB 1 & Instant Cast 1 to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Earth/Fire/Lightning Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if user has at least Lv.0/2 En-Earth/Fire/Lightning;
WS Blue: Grants [Lv.2 En-Earth/Fire/Lightning Stack] to user
WS Gold: Grants [During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 3 & Damage +50% to Earth/Fire/Lightning Abilities] to user

